\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 7 / 7 Pro Focus Keyboard\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 7 / 7 Pro Keyboard\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Focus Pen\u003c/span\u003e²⁴\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 7 / 7 Pro Cover\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 7 / 7 Pro Screen Protector\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1 Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e2 Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, compared with Xiaomi 13 Ultra.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e3 Color availability may vary by region.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e4 94% refers to the ratio of the display area and glass screen. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e5 Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, compared with Xiaomi 14.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e6 Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, compared with Xiaomi 14 Ultra.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e7 Power adapter included is vary by region. 90W power adapter sold separately. Using 90W power adapter is recommended. Wireless chargers sold separately.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e8 Use of eSIM requires a wireless service plan. This service plan may be subject to certain restrictions of use on switching service providers and roaming (even after contract expiration). eSIM availability may vary depending on country/region and carrier. For more details, please contact your carrier for more information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e9 Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e10 AI features available via OTA starting from March 2nd. Availability of AI features may vary based on region. Please check your local website for more information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e11 Wi-Fi connectivity (including Wi-Fi frequency bands, Wi-Fi standards and other features as ratified in IEEE Standard 802.11 specifications) may vary based on regional availability and local network support. The function may be added via OTA when and where applicable.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e12 Available in select languages. Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e13 Features shall be realized when the system software and the Gallery Editor App are updated to the latest version and internet is connected. Please refer to the actual use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e14 Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e15 Phones and tablets need to be upgraded to Xiaomi HyperOS 2 with Bluetooth and WLAN settings activated, log in to the same Xiaomi account, and make sure \"Settings-Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" is turned on. Availability of specific features, and services may vary depending on software version, apps and phone model, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e16 Installation of \"Xiaomi Connectivity Service\" app is required for compatibility with iOS/macOS platforms.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e17 Please check local sales channels for specific availability in your region.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e18 This promotion is available exclusively to new to Spotify Premium users, redeeming an individual plan. Spotify reserves the right to cancel the promotion at any time. T\u0026amp;Cs apply.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e19 New YouTube Premium users only. Terms apply. Monthly subscription fee starts at the end of trial. Cancel anytime.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e20 The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed for repair. For more information, please see Xiaomi official website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e21 The screen supports a maximum refresh rate of 144Hz. The screen refresh rate may be slightly different under different application interfaces and game image qualities. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e22 Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e23 Availability of Xiaomi Pad 7, Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro, and relevant accessories may vary across different regions, sold separately.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e24 Xiaomi Focus Pen is compatible with Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro 12.4, Xiaomi Pad 7 and Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e25 Prices listed below reflect European sales prices of the devices sold. Global prices may vary depending on VAT, taxes, and other factors.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e26 128GB storage variant uses UFS 3.1, while 256GB and 512GB storage variants use UFS 4.0.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e27 Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro Matte Glass Version sold separately and is only available for specific model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e28 Configurations available may differ across regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to the storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e29 Data tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs; the 200% volume boost is achieved by increasing the volume to 16 levels compared to 15 levels. Actual effects may vary depending on software and usage scenarios; please refer to the actual experience for final results.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e30 Results for illustrative purposes may vary. Check responses for accuracy. Internet connection and compatible operating system required. Availability may vary by device, country and language. Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e31 Qualcomm, Snapdragon and Adreno are trademarks or registered trademarks of Qualcomm Incorporated. Snapdragon and Qualcomm branded products are products of Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e32 The screen size of Xiaomi Pad 7 Series is about 11.2-inch in the full rectangle when measured diagonally. Actual viewable area is less due to the curved corner design and measurements between individual products may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2024, the MAU reached approximately 685.8 million globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 861.4 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2024. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"985","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1740925801"},"common":null}